cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this analysis code, please cite the paper below."
title: "ACDF discharge timing: analysis code (ACS-NSQIP 2012-2024)"
abstract: >-
  Cohort construction and statistical analysis code for a study of discharge
  timing after anterior cervical discectomy and fusion in the ACS-NSQIP Adult
  Participant Use Data File, 2012 to 2024. Contains no patient-level data.
type: software
license: MIT
